&lt;p&gt;LAHORE: Veteran journalist and human rights activist Husain Naqi passed away in Lahore on Sunday of a cardiac arrest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;He was a former editor of &lt;em&gt;The News&lt;/em&gt; and had also been associated with the Human Rights Commission of Pakistan (HRCP).&lt;/p&gt;
